        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c17158d7-f667-47f1-b332-a16f1b91039a\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad experience. When we open, friquently they were asking about premium..\"},{\"review_id\":\"704f785f-94ed-4603-9494-42d33e226733\",\"review_text\":\"Actually good app🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"f567be19-9981-4eb5-a3cd-507e1c2746d2\",\"review_text\":\"It so good it works so fast\"},{\"review_id\":\"ee10177b-a6ad-4512-8c1f-330ad835c890\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad on the watch. I faced multiple desync issues IN A SINGLE DAY and an overall laggy ui experience. Massive headache!\"},{\"review_id\":\"2a884e45-dde3-40b4-85cd-c3444e335d40\",\"review_text\":\"This app is so excellent it filled with nice doppest music ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"065e5b47-02ab-4524-a309-068d8c51f3f1\",\"review_text\":\"Why am i getting ads on podcasts on my premium account? What is the point of paying a premium!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"c864f548-5f61-4f28-86c2-337c875d1365\",\"review_text\":\"❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶🫶\"},{\"review_id\":\"f162dd21-3f6b-4fee-9f14-e642bf230da0\",\"review_text\":\"SUVAYAN\"},{\"review_id\":\"986e5431-3132-4496-9a79-f1d1ad99e858\",\"review_text\":\"-10000000 Even the basic functions is available only for premium, which is horrible. You can't even play the selected song, worst of all streaming apps. Coz there is no negative rating I'm going 1 star.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4fb7e012-f7d5-4330-aa2c-ec043be5166d\",\"review_text\":\"👌 awesome\"}]}"
